o the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nWhen the whole class was having the physics exam, the teacher gave a warning not to cheat during the exam and informed all the students about the circumstances. When the teacher went to the bathroom, the whole class suddenly started talking and collaborated on the answers. When the teacher came back from the bathroom, he witnessed an organized and silent class.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would the teacher ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Oblivious & Gratitude\nB) Admiration & Disapproval\nC) Disapproval & Sadness\nD) Admiration & Oblivious\nE) Guilt & Sadness\nF) Admiration & Guilt\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would the teacher feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) the teacher does not know that the students cheated when he was away & the teacher is unaware of the students' academic struggles\nB) the teacher does not know that the students cheated when he was away & the teacher admires the students' initiative to lead the class in his absence\nC) the teacher is unaware of the students' academic struggles & the teacher admires the students' initiative to lead the class in his absence\nD) the teacher admires the students' self-discipline for keeping the class quiet and organized while he was away & the teacher does not know that the students cheated when he was away\nE) the students cheated on the exam when the teacher asked them not to & nobody talked when the teacher was away\nF) the teacher is unaware of the students' academic struggles & nobody talked when the teacher was away","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e6d6006945d280aba3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369766708,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"59db3cb3a446411db18dbbdbfaf0a28a"}